    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">How I Built a Fantasy Football Platform with AI (And You Can Too)</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8">Published July 2, 2026</p>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      TINEZ started as a joke between friends. It ended as a full fantasy football platform with AI-powered trade analysis, IDP rankings, and live draft tools.
    </p>

    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      Here's the stack: <strong>Astro</strong> on the frontend, <strong>Supabase</strong> for the database, <strong>Sleeper API</strong> and <strong>API-SPORTS</strong> for real-time data. The AI Trade Analyzer runs on local LLMs — no cloud API costs, no rate limits, no privacy concerns.
    </p>

    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      The whole thing runs on a $25/month Supabase plan and a Mac Mini. No cloud bill. No VC money. Just good engineering and a love for the game.
    </p>

    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      Want to build something similar? The blueprint is open source. Check the repo at <a href="https://github.com/cc3po/tinez" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">github.com/cc3po/tinez</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
